Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 09:43:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] uwcclient and uwcctl: Taproot-signed deposits, job ops and
 council proposals against a pearld node (build step 7)

node/uwcclient: keys, coin selection over the address index (skipping coins spent in the
mempool and immature coinbases), signing, several ops per transaction, op references as the
node computes them, job-state queries. cmd/uwcctl: send, deposit, stake, unstake, withdraw,
modelreg, jobpost, propose-category/fe/retire, approve, fe-reveal, and queries.
jobstate.TagHash is exported for ids.

